# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# NOTE: the Content-Security-Policy is NOT set here. It is generated per-page by
# Astro (see `security.csp` in astro.config.ts) so that the hashes for Astro's
# own inline hydration scripts stay correct on every build. Setting a second
# CSP here would intersect with that one and block the scanner.
#
# The CSP is deliberately tight: this site loads no third-party script, makes no
# XHR/fetch calls, and never connects anywhere at runtime.
#
# When Cloudflare Web Analytics is enabled, add to script-src and connect-src:
#   https://static.cloudflareinsights.com
# Enabling AdSense later requires loosening this substantially — keep that
# change isolated to this file so it is reviewable in one diff (PRD §40).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/og.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
